window.docContents[81].resolve({"/Class-group-checks/#Quadratic-Number-Fields-Blueprint--Class-group-checks":{"contents":"\n\nQsqrtd.minkowskiBound d specializes the number-field Minkowski bound to the\nquadratic field , using\nthe discriminant formula as the size input.\n\nEvery ideal class has a representative whose norm is at most\nthe specialized Minkowski bound.\n\nThe imaginary quadratic branch has the explicit constant\n, refining\nthe generic representative bound under\nthe Minkowski specialization.\n\nThe real quadratic branch has the explicit constant ,\nrefining the generic representative bound\nin the real case via the Minkowski specialization.\n\nThe  example contains concrete bounded-norm checks that exercise\nthe imaginary Minkowski bound and\nthe representative theorem, alongside\nthe concrete ideal factorizations.\n\nA future class-group pipeline should turn\nthe Minkowski representative theorem into\nfinite norm searches for selected quadratic fields and families.\n\nThe planned output of\nthe finite-check machinery is reusable\ncertificates for class-number-one or nontrivial class-group computations,\nultimately feeding concrete examples.\n\n","context":"Quadratic Number Fields Blueprint","header":"7. Class-group checks","id":"/Class-group-checks/#Quadratic-Number-Fields-Blueprint--Class-group-checks"}});